name: the chat panel's Options tab: Credits opens the pop-up browser (UIPopupBrowserClass 5 'CREDITS': http://www.enb-emulator.com, a string in client.exe) and its close box closes it
# ui_chat_panel.cpp's 0x569A00 ('Credits') makes UIPopupBrowserClass (ui_popup_browser.cpp, 'JWEB01', fc_jweb01.ini);
# its Unknown_60 hands the browser model's 'BROWSER' box to the settings store's 0x7CA5C0 (settings_store.cpp),
# which takes the URL from the store's table (0x7C97B0: client.exe's strings at 0x79FE90 ff.) and calls
# DX8WebBrowser::CreateBrowser (BrowserEngine.dll, in-game: no external browser). The page is live: it may load or
# fail, the scenario asserts only the window. Closing it calls ui_popup_browser.cpp's PopupBrowserSettingsClass::
# Unknown_7CB240, a stand-in in place of the store's own 0x7CB240 (DestroyBrowser): the page stays drawn over the
# world and the store's +0x34 stays set, so no other chat-panel browser opens in this session (hence the XFAIL;
# it runs last, e2e.py's LAST, and an XFAIL ends its client).
expected-fail: the browser is never destroyed: ui_popup_browser.cpp calls a phantom PopupBrowserSettingsClass::Unknown_7CB240 (a stand-in) instead of the settings store's 0x7CB240
timeout: 400
include _login
stand-in 'PopupBrowserSettingsClass::Unknown_7CB240'
click gadget chat.tab.options
alive 0.5
click gadget options.credits
expect-event proxy 'fc_jweb01\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 2.0 within 30
alive 8
shot browser_credits
click gadget browser.close
expect-event proxy 'fc_jweb01\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
key 0xC0
expect-event antprox 'received REQUEST_TARGET 0x0017, 8 bytes' within 10
